    <item>
      <title>Genie Agents enhancements</title>
      <link>https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/databricks/release-notes/product/2026/november#genie-agents-enhancements</link>
      <guid isPermaLink="true">https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/databricks/release-notes/product/2026/november#genie-agents-enhancements</guid>
      <pubDate>Mon, 02 Nov 2026 00:00:00 Z</pubDate>
      <category>Genie</category>
      <description>&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Analyze files in Unity Catalog volumes (Public Preview)&lt;/strong&gt;: A Genie Agent can now analyze unstructured files stored in Unity Catalog volumes. See &lt;a href="/azure/databricks/genie-agents/volumes"&gt;Analyze files in volumes with a Genie Agent&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Agent memory&lt;/strong&gt;: Genie Agents remember earlier turns. See &lt;a href="/azure/databricks/genie-agents/memory"&gt;Memory&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;</description>
    </item>
